<title>USA: AMEX to trade LEAPS Nov 4 on HFS Inc.</title>
<headline>AMEX to trade LEAPS Nov 4 on HFS Inc.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Stock Exchange said Friday it would list Long-Term Equity Anticipation Securities (LEAPS) on HFS Inc on Nov 4.</p>
<p>The options, with expirations in January 1998 and January 1999, would have opening strike prices of 60, 75 and 90.</p>
<p>Spear, Leeds &amp; Kellogg will be the specialist.</p>
<p>Friday afternoon, shares of the hotel and real estate franchiser were up 1-1/8 at 74-3/8.</p>
<p>--Derivatives desk, 312-408-8750</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
